\newlabel{fig:gram_computation}{{6}{11}{Gram matrix computation captures second-order statistics. The matrix $\mathbf {G} = \frac {1}{T}\mathbf {H}\mathbf {H}^\top $ encodes channel-to-channel correlations, where $\mathbf {G}_{ij}$ measures how features $i$ and $j$ co-activate across time}{figure.caption.13}{}}
